Rectangular plot with approximately 49.2 metres of northern frontage and 18 metres depth. Registered acquisitions comprise an unnumbered two-storey collective residential building and an unnumbered garage. The survey reports 20 rental rooms and structural connections to an open-sided covered area. Verify structure, registration and permits.

Access is private land, deed 138455. SAM reports a registered easement benefiting the property for pedestrian and vehicle access, electricity, water, telephone, drainage and other utilities. The concrete carriageway is approximately four metres wide within a six-metre right of way. Verify the easement instrument, scope and actual access; this is not represented as a public road.

SAM reports light-orange planning zoning with white dots and residential surroundings. Nearby source-listed places include Chonburi Polytechnic College, Bang Saen Telephone Exchange and Chatuchak Market.

From Nong Mon Market toward Chon Buri on Sukhumvit Road, pass Wat Bang Paeng and Chatuchak Market. After kilometre 102, enter Soi Huai Kapi 16 on the right for approximately 1.3 kilometres; the property is on the right.

